      <constraints />
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry id="2976-8d80-903d-777a-bf89a" name="Rhino Primaris" hidden="false" collective="false" type="model">
          <profiles />
          <rules>
            <rule id="bfc6-f141-e23a-2158-bf89a" name="Servo-Skull Hub" hidden="false">
              <profiles />
              <rules />
              <infoLinks />
              <modifiers />
              <description>At the start of your shooting phase, choose a unit within 12" of the Rhino Primaris. They gain one of the following effects (each is One Use Only): Targeting Data Skull - Fire Snap Shots at full BS. Repair Skull (vehicles only): Roll a D6. On a 2+, the vehicle regains a hull point. Vox Skull - the unit gains fearless until the start of your next turn.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="6208-e1a8-2570-6469-bf89a" hidden="false" targetId="9fe7c55f-8015-f2f4-0231-87b63e0fae6d-bf89a" type="profile">
