        <selectionEntry id="2835-9644-b0b4-2d8f-bf89a" name="Dual Void Shield Generator" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade">
          <profiles />
          <rules>
            <rule id="73d0-624e-7a37-18b6-bf89a" name="Dual Void Shield Generator" hidden="false">
              <profiles />
              <rules />
              <infoLinks />
              <modifiers />
              <description>Whilst the model's void shields are active, any hits scored by shooting attacks against it strike its void shields instead. The Sokar 
has two void shields, each with an Armour value of 12. A Glancing hit or Penetrating hit or any hit by a Destroyer weapon 
scored against a shield causes it to collapse. After this, further hits strike the original target instead. At the end of each of its 
controlling player's turns, roll a D6 for each collapsed shield - a roll of 5+ instantly restores it.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <constraints>
            <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="b39b-5816-6138-733c-bf89a" type="max" />
